    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take charge of the Polaris Mk 0 and repair your damaged ship, learn from your crewmates, and discover the true nature of what lies beyond existence\u2026 before you do it all over again. </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Follow the core tenants of the Sectorian Collective as you:</h2><br><strong>Seek Knowledge</strong><br><br>Each loop in the game will offer you new insights into how to efficiently rectify the Polaris Mk 0\u2019s many misfortunes whilst traveling through the Marion. Along the way, you\u2019ll pick up tools that persist through your runs and aid you in your quest to save your crewmates.<br><br><strong>Solve Problems</strong><br><br>As you breach the Marion, your crew\u2019s situation becomes more dangerous. It\u2019s your job to fix mechanical failures and keep everyone alive! You\u2019ll need to solve puzzling crises, assist your crewmates, and reach the bridge in time to save your ship. <br><br><strong>Always Put the Crew First</strong><br><br>Meet a colorful cast of aliens from all over the universe whom you get to call your crewmates. You\u2019ll help each other as you make choices that will affect the success of the mission and your survival.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join us\u2026 Beyond the Marion!</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Take charge of the Polaris Mk 0 and repair your damaged ship, learn from your crewmates, and discover the true nature of what lies beyond existence\u2026 before you do it all over again. </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Follow the core tenants of the Sectorian Collective as you:</h2><br><strong>Seek Knowledge</strong><br><br>Each loop in the game will offer you new insights into how to efficiently rectify the Polaris Mk 0\u2019s many misfortunes whilst traveling through the Marion. Along the way, you\u2019ll pick up tools that persist through your runs and aid you in your quest to save your crewmates.<br><br><strong>Solve Problems</strong><br><br>As you breach the Marion, your crew\u2019s situation becomes more dangerous. It\u2019s your job to fix mechanical failures and keep everyone alive! You\u2019ll need to solve puzzling crises, assist your crewmates, and reach the bridge in time to save your ship. <br><br><strong>Always Put the Crew First</strong><br><br>Meet a colorful cast of aliens from all over the universe whom you get to call your crewmates. You\u2019ll help each other as you make choices that will affect the success of the mission and your survival.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join us\u2026 Beyond the Marion!</h2>",
    "short_description": "A 3D First Person walking simulator and puzzle game. You will interact with your alien crewmates and repair your spaceship in order to escape a time loop. Explore space in a ship straight from the 70\u2019s, and meet your companions - brought to life with a funky claymated style!",
